        "message": "This adapter hides read or write from SQL analysis (conditional selection). Call the executor on the SQL text (`read(sql) or write(sql) or (flag ? read : write)(sql)`). `visibleBag({ query: read }) or visibleBag({ query: write })` is not a judged rewrite: analysis does not follow an executor passed as a value. Write the direct call explicitly. Analysis cannot check SQL that only reaches the executor through this adapter.",
        "messageId": "blocked",
        "ruleId": "no-mistakes/postgres-no-executor-adapter",
