        "message": "This adapter hides read or write from SQL analysis (conditional selection). Call the executor on the SQL text (`read(sql) or write(sql) or (flag ? read : write)(sql)`). `hidden(sql`SELECT ${fragment} FROM t`, read) or hidden(sql`SELECT ${fragment} FROM t`, write)` is not a judged rewrite: analysis does not follow an executor passed as a value. Write the direct call explicitly. Analysis cannot check SQL that only reaches the executor through this adapter.",
